The one deliberately large query: call site run(os.Args[1:]) in main, i.e. everything
the program can report. Must contain the opaque usage error, the settings set (config
package incl. encoding/json), the errors importAll returns through jobs.Run under
"jobs: step: %w" (walk.ErrTooMany, jobs.ErrNoHook, hook error, context sentinels ...)
and the diagnostics leaves. importFile's own errors (source.ErrEmpty, records.ErrNoRows,
stream.ErrQuota ...) are only remembered via murky.Remember and must NOT appear
except behind the murky.lastErr global.
-- args --
main.go:@runcall
